BEHAVIOR array-len

DESCRIPTION
  Returns the number of elements currently stored in an int array (its len
  field), as set by array-init (0) and array-push.

CONTRACT
  INPUT arr bytes 65536
  OUTPUT length int 8
  GUARANTEES writes_output

HASH c80c400a

IMPLEMENTATION
  l = LOAD arr 8 0
  STORE length l 8
END
